      "message": "Per STM32 command set document, CMD_WU/WP/RU/RP needs to get ACK twice after sending command.\nIn this code, wait_for_ack() after send_command is necessary. meanwhile send_command_retry() with ACK_POLL does secondary wait_for_ack() only it gets timeout from send_command().\n\nHowever, I am undoing this. This is a simple transaction (command transfer once and acks twice), and just I don\u0027t think it is worthy to increase complication here.",
